
Creates a new instance and sets the property values for the new instance.
USAGE:

CREATE <assign list>
NOTE: <assign list> can be more than one property name separated by commas.
Each property name should be followed by '=' and its value.

NOTE: Create cannot be used to create a new class.

The following properties are available:
Property				Type			Operation
========				====			=========
Category                           	N/A                 	N/A       
CategoryString                     	N/A                 	N/A       
ComputerName                       	N/A                 	N/A       
Data                               	N/A                 	N/A       
EventCode                          	N/A                 	N/A       
EventIdentifier                    	N/A                 	N/A       
InsertionStrings                   	N/A                 	N/A       
LogFile                            	N/A                 	N/A       
Message                            	N/A                 	N/A       
RecordNumber                       	N/A                 	N/A       
SourceName                         	N/A                 	N/A       
TimeGenerated                      	N/A                 	N/A       
TimeWritten                        	N/A                 	N/A       
Type                               	N/A                 	N/A       
TypeEvent                          	N/A                 	N/A       
UserName                           	N/A                 	N/A       

